> I'm trying to work with some network structures in R and use igraph
> package. I'm mainly interested in dynamic aspects of my networks, so I
> start with an initial network and then do a lot of add.vertices and
> add.edges operations.
> now, here is my problem:
> in one of my networks my edges are in fact weighted edges. when I "add" an
> edge I want that if there is no existing edge between the given nodes, then
> a new edge with the given weight will be added. However, if there is
> already an edge between the given nodes, I don't want a new (parallel) edge
> to be created, but rather, I want that the new weight will be added to the
> existing weight.
>
> I don't know how to do that.
> any suggestions?
>
> thanks,
